				</ukm:Metadata><Secondary><Body DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1995/2994/body" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1995/2994/body" NumberOfProvisions="118" RestrictStartDate="2020-12-31"><Part DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1995/2994/part/II" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1995/2994/part/II" NumberOfProvisions="57" id="part-II" RestrictStartDate="2020-12-31"><Number>PART II</Number><Title>Principal Road Safety Provisions</Title><Pblock DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1995/2994/part/II/crossheading/driving-offences" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1995/2994/part/II/crossheading/driving-offences" NumberOfProvisions="7" RestrictExtent="N.I." RestrictStartDate="2008-07-16" id="part-II-crossheading-driving-offences"><Title>Driving Offences</Title><P1group RestrictStartDate="2006-01-01"><Title>Causing death, or grievous bodily injury, by dangerous driving</Title><P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1995/2994/article/9" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1995/2994/article/9" id="article-9"><Pnumber>9</Pnumber><P1para><Text>A person who causes the death of, or grievous bodily injury to, another person by driving a mechanically propelled vehicle dangerously on a road or other public place is guilty of an offence.</Text></P1para></P1></P1group></Pblock></Part></Body></Secondary></Legislation>